strategy, autonomous product systems and new interaction models"},{"text":"Check the official site"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The durable skill is not simply knowing product-management tools."},{"type":"p","text":"It is the ability to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Understand users","identify problems","validate opportunities","define products","prioritize","coordinate execution","measure outcomes","iterate"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"flow","items":["Programming","APIs","databases","cloud fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"flow","items":["SQL","statistics","product analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"flow","items":["Discovery","PRDs","roadmaps","prioritization"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"UX"},{"type":"flow","items":["User research","wireframing","usability"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business models","market analysis","unit economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Execution"},{"type":"flow","items":["Agile","Scrum","stakeholder management"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Experimentation"},{"type":"h","text":"A/B testing + hypothesis-driven development"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"flow","items":["Writing","presentations","storytelling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI Product Management","platform products","technical product strategy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Portfolio Target"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim to have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2–3 product teardowns"},{"text":"1 user-research project"},{"text":"2 detailed PRDs"},{"text":"1 product roadmap"},{"text":"1 SQL/product analytics project"},{"text":"1 experimentation case study"},{"text":"1 working MVP"},{"text":"1 complete end-to-end product case study"},{"text":"At least one product/business internship"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest APM portfolio should show the complete chain:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","User Research","Opportunity","Product Requirements","Prioritization","Design","Engineering","Launch","Metrics","Experiment","Iteration"]},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSBS graduate, combining this product skill set with genuine technical understanding can also open paths into technical product management, product analytics, platform products and technology strategy."}]}]}